  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ecological and Low-Carbon Food Systems in China (PPG)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this child project is to promote the transformation of China?s agricultural and food system, drive the ecological low carbon, climate resilience, environmental friendliness and comprehensive production capacity, reduce the environmental degradation and negative externalities caused by the whole supply chain of food system (food crops, livestock and aquaculture) from the production to the consumption, and ensure the sustainable and effective supply of important agricultural products such as food</narrative>
